{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575940/extras/Library_Logo.png?t=1743027241\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Command the Skies in a High-Octane Steampunk Bullet Hell!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a powerful steampunk airship and soar into battle across stunning hand-drawn skies. <br><br><strong>Dodge waves of bullets</strong>, unleash devastating firepower, and prove your skill in this fast-paced, action-packed bullet hell shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575940/extras/BrigandsGif3.gif?t=1743027241\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Blast Through Three Distinct Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through beautifully crafted steampunk-inspired landscapes, each teeming with relentless enemies and intricate bullet patterns. Each world consisting new dangers and foes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575940/extras/BrigandsGif1.gif?t=1743027241\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>three unique and formidable bosses</strong>, each more intense than the last. Can you survive the storm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575940/extras/BrigandsGif4.gif?t=1743027241\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Upgrade. Customize. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect loot to upgrade your ship\u2019s stats and arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the <strong>Hangar</strong> to enhance your Health, Armor, and Energy\u2014fuel for your powerful secondary weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop by the <strong>Weapons Shop</strong> to unlock a 